# The repo root is the extension directory, and a shop serves it under
# extension/two/. Only the runtime paths are public: admin/, catalog/,
# system/ and install.json. Everything else (dev/, tests/, .git, the repo
# tooling) is refused. The CLI scripts also refuse web requests themselves.
<If "%{REQUEST_URI} =~ m#/extension/two/(?!(admin|catalog|system)/|install\.json$)#">
    Require all denied
</If>
